Name:           syncspace
Version:        @RPM_VERSION@
Release:        @RPM_RELEASE@
Summary:        Private local-network file transfer
License:        Apache-2.0
URL:            https://github.com/louisboii747/syncspace
Source0:        syncspace-payload.tar
BuildArch:      @RPM_ARCH@
Requires:       systemd
Requires:       xdg-utils

%description
SyncSpace sends files directly between explicitly paired devices on the same
local network. It includes a loopback-only management interface, encrypted
peer transport, persistent device identity, transfer history, and a per-user
systemd service. It does not require a cloud relay.

%prep

%build

%install
mkdir -p %{buildroot}
tar -xf %{SOURCE0} -C %{buildroot}

%files
%license /usr/share/licenses/syncspace/LICENSE
%doc /usr/share/doc/syncspace/service.env.example
/usr/bin/syncspace
/usr/libexec/syncspace/syncspace-server
/usr/lib/systemd/user/syncspace.service
/usr/share/applications/syncspace.desktop
/usr/share/icons/hicolor/scalable/apps/syncspace.svg
/usr/share/metainfo/syncspace.metainfo.xml
/usr/share/man/man1/syncspace.1.gz

%changelog
* @RPM_CHANGELOG_DATE@ SyncSpace maintainers <noreply@github.com> - @RPM_VERSION@-@RPM_RELEASE@
- Build the signed GitHub Release package.
